@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title DELETE /api/workspace/v1/messenger/stream_bindings/[binding_uuid]
actor "Der Client" as Client
participant "WorkspaceStreamBindingController\nRestAlchemy" as API
database "PostgreSQL\nKanonische Zeilen + Anschlüsse" as DB
queue "Transactional outbox\n+ Typisierte Aufgaben ausführen" as Outbox
participant "Hintergrund-Bauern\nexact scope leases + fencing" as Worker
database "Fertige Projektionen\nKontainerbindungen" as Projection
database "Speicher für öffentliche Veranstaltungen" as Events
participant "- Das ist der Controller . WebSocket" as Dispatcher
actor "Der Client WebSocket" as WS
Client -> API: DELETE /api/workspace/v1/messenger/stream_bindings/{binding_uuid}
API -> DB: lock persistent USER_STREAM_BINDING\nactive=false; membership_generation++
API -> DB: immutable outbox event für jede typed task
DB --> API: Transaktion festzulegen
API --> Client: eine erfolgreiche öffentliche Antwort
DB ->> Outbox: festgehaltenes Ereignis
Outbox ->> Worker: topic_membership_policy_rebuild / read_counters /\nfolder_projection / delivery_snapshot_event\njede task hat seine outbox_event_uuid
Worker -> Worker: topic scope: Verbergen placement access;\nuser-stream/user-folder: shared projections
Worker -> DB: conditional by active=false + new generation;\nstale generation = no-op
Worker -> Projection: Restliche Zugriffsbindungen/Container
Worker -> Events: Streaming/Verknüpfung/Ordner-Entfernung\nAtomisch in einer DB transaction mit einer Projektion
Events ->> Dispatcher: festgelegte bereitgestellte Zeile
Dispatcher ->> WS: Versenden / Wiederholen / Wiederholen
note over API,Worker
  Nachher commit - Das ist alles. message/reaction paths Sie verlangen active membership
  und generation equality; cleanup Die alten rows Nein . security boundary.
  Task lifecycle: lease expiry/fencing, retry/backoff, DLQ/reaper.
end note
@enduml
